# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PERSONAL "BRAIN" / MEMORY — NEVER COMMIT (this repo is PUBLIC)
# Knowledge graph, conversation history, feedback, cognitive profile, any export.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Database (local user data — the brain)
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
you-port-device.key
prismos-audit.log
# Encrypted exports are private data too. Ciphertext, filenames, timestamps,
# and Git history can still disclose metadata, so use a separate private backup
# location rather than this public source repository.
*.prismos
*.prismos-sync
*.prismos-vault
private-backups/
# App data directory (knowledge graph, profile, audit log) if ever copied into repo
**/com.prismos.app/
